error[elab/unparen-outside-hint-unsupported]: unparenthesizing operator `##` is not allowed outside a hint
  ┌─ elab/type-unparen-outside-hint.watsup:5:10
  │
4 │ dec $f : nat
  │          --- return value of function '$f' expects 'nat'
5 │ def $f = ## 0
  │          ^^^^
  │
  = The `##` operator strips parentheses only while rendering a hint.

